        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 0.9rem;">Wavertree is packed with Victorian terraces. It also has lots of students and young renters, who move in and out often. Homes around Wavertree Road, Picton Road and Lawrence Road are often split into flats or student houses. So the plumbing works much harder than it was built for in the 1880s and 1890s.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 0.9rem;">Busy rented homes put a lot of strain on boilers, showers and waste pipes. A boiler built for two or three people will fail sooner if six people use it. We work on Wavertree rented homes all the time. We offer <a href="/power-flushing-liverpool" style="color:#c2410c;font-weight:700;">power flushing</a> for systems with cold radiators.</p>
